Error: Jet.OperatorTypeMismatch: `+` can't compare or combine U8 (an 8-bit whole number, 0 to 255) and I8 (an 8-bit whole number, -128 to 127)
  --> Tests/UI/mixed_numbers.jet:4:8
    |
  4 |     x: unsigned + signed
    |        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Neither U8 contains every value of I8, nor I8 every value of U8
 Fix: Choose the result type and convert the other side into it
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.OperatorTypeMismatch
